{"ref":"BDB, חוּר²","hw":"חוּר²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חוּר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>meaning dub.; cf. Nab. n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חורו</span> Nö in Eut<sup>p. 45</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  𝔊 Ωρ, named with Aaron as compan. of Moses <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:10\" href=\"/Exodus.17.10\">Ex 17:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:12\" href=\"/Exodus.17.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:14\" href=\"/Exodus.24.14\">24:14</a> (all E).<br><strong>2.</strong>  𝔊 Ωρ, a Judahite <a data-ref=\"Exodus 31:2\" href=\"/Exodus.31.2\">Ex 31:2</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:30\" href=\"/Exodus.35.30\">35:30</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:22\" href=\"/Exodus.38.22\">38:22</a> (all P) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.19\">1 Ch 2:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:50\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.50\">50</a> (on div. of verse v. Be VB); also <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.1\">4:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.4\">4</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.5\">2 Ch 1:5</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  𝔊 Ουρ, a king of Midian <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:8\" href=\"/Numbers.31.8\">Nu 31:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:21\" href=\"/Joshua.13.21\">Jos 13:21</a> (both P).<br><strong>4.</strong>  𝔊L Σουρ (B om.) head of fam. of returned exiles <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.9\">Ne 3:9</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־חוּר</span> officer of Sol. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.8\">1 K 4:8</a>, v. sub <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, בֵּן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_בֵּן\">בֵּן</a> p. 122.","next":"BDB, חוּר³","prev":"BDB, חֹרִי"}